# Story 18: Pane Info & Listing (##pane) (40s)
# Hook: Ask rysh about itself -- inspect any pane, list them all, and replay its history.
# Duration: 40s
# Source: story-018-pane-info-listing.tape
#
# Voiceover script with timing cues.
# Format: [START --> END] narration text
# Each entry should be spoken within its time window.
# Gaps between entries are silent (viewer watches the demo).
#
# Total segments: 6

[00:00.0 --> 00:04.0]
Ask rysh about itself -- inspect any pane, list them all, and replay its history.

[00:04.0 --> 00:09.0]
Start rysh and split so we have more than one pane.

[00:09.0 --> 00:17.0]
Switch to rysh mode and run ##pane info to see the active pane's id, name, mode, and group.

[00:17.0 --> 00:25.0]
##pane list shows every pane in the current tab at a glance.

[00:25.0 --> 00:34.0]
Run a couple of commands first, then ##pane history shell replays this pane's shell history. Swap in prompt for AI turns.

[00:34.0 --> 00:40.0]
info, list, history -- everything you need to understand your panes, right from rysh mode.

